      "id": "upload-local-symbols",
      "name": "UploadLocalSymbols",
      "category": "WindowsPlatformStackWalk",
      "signature": "UploadLocalSymbols()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Upload localy built symbols to network symbol storage.\nUse case:\nGame designers use game from source (without prebuild game .dll-files).\nIn this case all game .dll-files are compiled locally.\nFor post-mortem debug programmers need .dll and .pdb files from designers."
